### LocalStay API Requests (.http file for VS / VS Code REST Client)
@gateway = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Gateway Health Check
GET {{gateway}}/health

### 2. Catalog - Get Properties (First request -> X-Cache: MISS)
GET {{gateway}}/api/catalog/properties

### 3. Catalog - Get Properties (Second request -> X-Cache: HIT)
GET {{gateway}}/api/catalog/properties

### 4. Catalog - Get Rooms for Property 1
GET {{gateway}}/api/catalog/properties/1/rooms

### 5. Booking - Check Room Availability
GET {{gateway}}/api/bookings/availability?roomId=1&checkIn=2027-06-01&checkOut=2027-06-03

### 6. Booking - Create Booking (Valid)
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "guestName": "John Doe",
  "guestEmail": "john@example.com",
  "checkIn": "2027-06-01",
  "checkOut": "2027-06-03"
}

### 7. Booking - Duplicate Booking on Same Room/Dates (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "guestName": "Jane Smith",
  "guestEmail": "jane@example.com",
  "checkIn": "2027-06-01",
  "checkOut": "2027-06-03"
}

### 8. Concierge - Ask Question (Grounded in Real Data)
POST {{gateway}}/api/concierge/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the price and capacity for Deluxe King Suite?",
  "roomId": 1
}

### 9. Concierge - Ask Made-Up Room (Grounding Guard Refusal)
POST {{gateway}}/api/concierge/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can I book Room 999 in Paris?",
  "roomId": 999
}

### 10. Check Individual Services Readiness
GET http://localhost:5101/health/ready
###
GET http://localhost:5102/health/ready
###
GET http://localhost:5103/health/ready
